          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " stirred through at the end. Using unsalted butter or ghee achieves a similar result. The saag must be cooked long enough to lose all its raw bitterness."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Partially blend after the long cook. The texture should be rough, not a smooth puree. Some whole leaf pieces should remain."
          }
        ]
